_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd:p000","text":"王誕字茂世太保弘從祖兄也祖恬晉中軍將軍父混太常卿誕少有才藻晉孝武帝崩從叔尚書令珣為哀策出本示誕曰猶恨少序節物誕攬筆便益之接其秋冬代變後云霜繁廣除風回高殿珣歎美因而用之襲爵雉鄉侯為會稽王世子元顯後軍長史琅邪內史誕結事元顯嬖人張法順故見寵元顯納妾誕為之親迎隨府轉驃騎長史內史如故元顯討桓𤣥欲悉誅諸桓誕救桓修等由此得免修誕甥也及𤣥得志將見誅修為陳請乃徙廣州","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd:p000:m0000","surface":"王誕","start":0,"end":2,"person_id":"vhf_729_g6z","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd:p000:m0003","surface":"茂世","start":3,"end":5,"person_id":"vhf_729_g6z","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd:p000:m0007","surface":"弘","start":7,"end":8,"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd:p000:m0013","surface":"恬","start":13,"end":14,"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAC","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd:p000:m0020","surface":"混","start":20,"end":21,"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAACA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd:p000:m0024","surface":"誕","start":24,"end":25,"person_id":"vhf_729_g6z","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd:p000:m0039","surface":"珣","start":39,"end":40,"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangdan-gu-yan-wyd:p000:m0046","surface":"誕","start":46,"end":47,"person_id":"vhf_729_g6z","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangda