t":"景仁幼時與安相及，為安所知。始為前軍行參軍、輔國參軍事。會稽王世子元顯嬖人張法順，權傾一時，內外無不造門者，唯景仁不至。年三十，方為著作佐郎。桓玄誅元顯，見景仁，甚知之，謂四坐曰：「司馬庶人父子云何不敗，遂令謝景仁三十方作著作佐郎。」玄為太尉，以補行參軍，府轉大將軍，仍參軍事。玄建楚臺，以補黃門侍郎。及篡位，領驍騎將軍。景仁博聞強識，善敍前言往行，玄每與之言，不倦也。玄出行，殷仲文、卞範之之徒，皆騎馬散從，而使景仁陪輦。","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren:p002:m0000","surface":"景仁","start":0,"end":2,"person_id":"684_eaa_511","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren:p002:m0005","surface":"安","start":5,"end":6,"person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren:p002:m0010","surface":"安","start":10,"end":11,"person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren:p002:m0033","surface":"元顯","start":33,"end":35,"person_id":"c03_362_4d7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren:p002:m0037","surface":"張法順","start":37,"end":40,"person_id":"xee_hex_u4o","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren:p002:m0055","surface":"景仁","start":55,"end":57,"person_id":"684_eaa_511","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren:p002:m0071","surface":"桓玄","start":71,"end":73,"person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_AAF","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren:p002:m0074","surface":"元顯","start":74,"end":76,"person_id":"c03_362_4d7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren:p002:m0078","surface":"景仁","start":78,"end":80,"person_id":"684_eaa_511","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren:p002:u0086","surface":"四坐